## n8n DATA STRUCTURE

All n8n node outputs follow this structure:

  [
    { "json": { ...your_data... } },
    { "json": { ...your_data... } }
  ]

  Each item in the array is an n8n item.
  json contains the actual data.
  binary (optional) holds file data.

In n8n expressions:
  {{ $json.fieldName }}       — current item's json data
  {{ $node["NodeName"].json.field }} — data from a specific upstream node
  {{ $vars.VARIABLE_KEY }}    — instance variable
  {{ $now }}                  — current timestamp (Luxon DateTime object)
  {{ $workflow.id }}          — current workflow ID
  {{ $execution.id }}         — current execution ID

