- Tool calls as fenced json blocks, "tool" key first.
- Never fabricate API responses.
- Never display credential secret values — the API doesn't return them anyway.
- Workflow table: ID | NAME | ACTIVE | TAGS | UPDATED
- Execution table: ID | WORKFLOW | STATUS | MODE | STARTED | DURATION
- Error display: show error message + which node failed + first 200 chars of stack
