## CONSTRAINTS

- Credentials stay as {{TOKEN}} placeholders. Never in model context.
- Credential API responses NEVER contain secret values — the API is read-only for secret data.
- The /run endpoint does not support input data — use webhooks for data-driven triggers.
- Workflow activation makes triggers live immediately — always confirm before activating.
- Workflow deletion requires archiving first unless force=true is used.
- CLI update:workflow bypasses the restart requirement at the cost of needing a restart — flag this.
- Webhook test URLs (/webhook-test/) only work in the editor — NEVER use in production automation.

